[{"id":"release-notes-00","source":"release-notes.txt","index":0,"section":"DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS RELEASE NOTES","sections":["DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS RELEASE NOTES","RELEASE 0.7, 2026-11-08: SEARCH THE HELP DOCUMENTS","RELEASE 0.6, 2026-11-07: HELP DOCUMENTS","RELEASE 0.5, 2026-11-03: SEARCH QUALITY CHECKS","RELEASE 0.4, 2026-10-31: QUESTION ANSWERING (DEVELOPER TOOL)","RELEASE 0.3, 2026-10-25 TO 2026-10-26: SEARCH"],"words":352,"overlapWords":0,"text":"DUCKS ON THE POND CARDS RELEASE NOTES\n\nLatest: November 2026 (test harness release), release 0.7\n\nThese notes list what changed in each release, newest first. Dates are when the change went in. Version numbers were assigned to group the changes and are not shown in the Application. For what the Application can do overall, see the Capabilities Summary (capabilities-summary.txt).\n\nRELEASE 0.7, 2026-11-08: SEARCH THE HELP DOCUMENTS\n\nNew - The Search page and POST /api/search now search the Ducks Corpus, this Application's own help documents.\n\nRemoved - The Trailhead Supply Co. course documents, which search used before. They were about a different business and could return unrelated answers.\n\nRELEASE 0.6, 2026-11-07: HELP DOCUMENTS\n\nNew - The Ducks Corpus: help documents for the card application, including the User's Guide, Customer Service Policy, Capabilities Summary and FAQ. Further documents (Terms of Use, Privacy Notice, Serial-Number Dispute Procedure, Collector Handbook, Glossary, Security and Incident Response, and a sample Pricing Guide) follow.\n\nRELEASE 0.5, 2026-11-03: SEARCH QUALITY CHECKS\n\nChanges (behind the scenes) - Added a fixed set of test questions with known answers, and a scoresheet, to measure how well search and answers perform. - Added checks that answers decline politely when the documents do not cover a question, and that instructions hidden inside a document are ignored. - The developer question-answering tool can now save a log of each run.\n\nNo change to the pages collectors use.\n\nRELEASE 0.4, 2026-10-31: QUESTION ANSWERING (DEVELOPER TOOL)\n\nNew - A command-line tool for developers (npm run ask) that answers questions from the reference documents using Anthropic's Claude model, quoting its sources. It is not part of the web Application yet.\n\nRELEASE 0.3, 2026-10-25 TO 2026-10-26: SEARCH\n\nNew - Search page. Ask a question in plain words and see the three closest passages from the reference documents, with source, section and a similarity score. - \"Not in the documents\" is shown when nothing scores at least 0.33, with the best score found. - Searches can be shared by copying the page address (/search?q=your+question). - POST /api/search for the same search from other clients. Questions can be up to 500 characters.","tokens":509,"embedding":[-0.04404246062040329,0.025371583178639412,-0.051796071231365204,0.0034513429272919893,0.0559166818857193,-0.014789127744734287,-0.046340689063072205,0.035916272550821304,0.0029011901933699846,0.023071013391017914,0.03539760783314705,0.01770378276705742,-0.0065162768587470055,-0.026944540441036224,0.012426646426320076,-0.008107095025479794,-0.015487461350858212,-0.03010767698287964,-0.028804883360862732,0.02571217156946659,0.028779733926057816,0.0676657035946846,0.03808568790555,0.006429913453757763,-0.05072622746229172,-0.025401489809155464,-0.12496699392795563,-0.0867510735988617,-0.08239994943141937,-0.011766616255044937,-0.036267444491386414,0.12247972935438156,0.04844802990555763,0.07516075670719147,0.07298233360052109,-0.015010802075266838,0.04387349635362625,0.015164248645305634,0.0068949065171182156,-0.05780400335788727,-0.058582454919815063,-0.046659570187330246,-0.0702333152294159,0.019942624494433403,-0.004821972455829382,-0.043198127299547195,-0.07851338386535645,-0.029900914058089256,-0.04120230674743652,0.07588241994380951,-0.10628366470336914,-0.04846930876374245,-0.05966605618596077,-0.004595848731696606,0.06630022078752518,0.03789544478058815,-0.031559109687805176,0.04222