 (collectors) and Carol (admin). Test login can be turned off per environment. - Catalog of sets, parallels, cards and variants, with automatic Base parallels and Base variants. - Collection tracking with grading, serial numbers, cert numbers, prices, tradeable and for-sale settings, sales and undoing a sale. - Serial-number protection with admin review of conflicts. - Wishlist with matching in both directions. - Trades: propose, accept, decline, counter, cancel and complete. - Reports: summary, inventory, for sale and sold. - Database row-level security, so collectors can change only their own data. - Page view and visitor counts (Vercel Web Analytics).\n\nChanges (behind the scenes) - Structured server logs for every request, with secrets removed before anything is written. - Database connections always check the server's certificate.\n\nRELEASE 0.1, 2026-10-23: FIRST BUILD\n\nNew - The Application's foundation on Next.js, React and TypeScript, hosted on Vercel with a Postgres database on Neon. - GET /api/health: reports whether the Application and database are up.\n\nFixed - A security update to a third-party library (zod).","tokens":452,"embedding":[-0.10823920369148254,-0.00419280119240284,-0.0834469124674797,0.020955482497811317,-0.009768816642463207,-0.04215293377637863,-0.08986088633537292,0.02870948612689972,-0.041407786309719086,0.01687726192176342,0.02941928245127201,-0.007437427993863821,0.08398797363042831,-0.03413796424865723,0.01150886993855238,-0.005092897918075323,0.04947555437684059,-0.036016035825014114,0.008572123013436794,0.010722075589001179,-0.02621256187558174,0.03327750414609909,0.05594165250658989,-0.005399017594754696,-0.07516847550868988,-0.038096390664577484,-0.10381036251783371,-0.05843737721443176,-0.10248146951198578,-0.03549382463097572,-0.03427901491522789,0.050418198108673096,-0.03803715482354164,0.11835495382547379,0.027595316991209984,-0.002403389196842909,0.022916490212082863,-0.05203695967793465,-0.019009683281183243,-0.0946724